  recording: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6a9d47579a2d25a4095977f3498395f5, type: 3}
  subtitles:
  - text: "Hey there. If you\u2019re listening to this, you\u2019re the new guy.
      Welcome to the family."
    duration: 4.5
  - text: "My name\u2019s John. I figured I\u2019d leave these logs to help you out..."
    duration: 4
  - text: ...since the manager... well, he doesn't tell you much.
    duration: 3.5
  - text: 'Rule number one: Don''t touch the animatronics. They look cute, but the
      joints are sharp.'
    duration: 7.5
  - text: 'Rule number two: Keep the music box wound up in the Prize Corner, it keeps
      the system... stable.'
    duration: 8
  - text: It's not a bad job, really. Lots of free pizza.
    duration: 3.5
  - text: "Speaking of which... I\u2019m starving. I\u2019m gonna head to the <color=yellow>Kitchen</color>
      to grab a slice."
    duration: 7
  - text: I'll record the next part there. Over and out.
    duration: 3.5
